                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore olorora le keper nerrarra aaku enterit. Ore oloing'ang'e pooki nepiyaya anaa endapana ore ilo orora pooki nerrarrunye anaa enasulunye mbenek o lng'aboli, anaa enasulunye ilng'abolo ooto to lchani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
