        },
        {
          "text": " Amu etudumunye olalem lai netaraposhe te shumata; ng'ura kesulakino ninye Edom te nkiguana, eumata lelo tung'ana latudung'oko nanu enkiguana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eeta Olaitoriani olalem oiputa osarge, neimulumulita eilata, te nebo osarge loo lkerra o lkineji, te nebo enkurriny oo lairakuj oo lkerra, amu kelo Olaitoriani aibung olasar te Bosara, kelo ninye aitayu esesekuanare kitok te Edom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa kedoiki ilosokuani ninche, te nebo ilmong'i o loing'ok magil. Ore ina kop enye neiput osarge, ore ina kop enye nenyilu te ilata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu eeta Olaitoriani enkolong e lap, ina olong nalo aitalaku elap te nkaraki Sion. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilkejek le Edom neibelekenya aatiu anaa enkoronko, neaku enkulukuoni enye enkima nakutu isoito neaku ina kop enkoronko nayupuyup. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.14.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Emb 14.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.19.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "19.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore dama o kewarie nemeye ina kima; neilep empuruo enye alo shumata ntarasi. Ore too ishoritin pooki neaku ina kop mijooni; nemeitoki oltung'ani aim ntarasi o ntarasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake kelo aaku le nkalem o yiyai otii ina kop ore emotonyi oo nkiyiaa o lkurruk nemany ine. Neitorioki Olaitoriani olmilo ina kop nedoiki enyamali lelo kituaak lenyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neipoti ine aajo, “Enemetii enkitoria”, ore lelo kituaak lenyena pooki neaku pesho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebulaki ilkiku lelo sempewueti lenyena nebulaki olkurushashi o suut lelo sempewueti lenyena o nkang'itie enyena naagol. Nelo ine aaku emanyisho oo mbariak ewueji nemany isidan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nepuo mbariak aashulare ilng'ojiniaa, neipotu oloirirua le ntim olikae, nejokino, ee, eisidai enkewarie tene, neing'uraki kewan ewueji neyeng'iyeng'are. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Te ine elo entaritiki aitobir enkaji enye, nepik inkiyioitin enyena abori oloip lenye; ee te ine epuo aaiturrurro ilkurragoso epuo maare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ing'oru isuma te mbuku o Laitoriani; meetae hoo nabo e kuna nemelo aaku; nemeetae ake enemelotu eboitare enkae. Amu enkutuk o Laitoriani naitanapishe, naa Enkiyang'et enye naiturrurro pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etooshoko ninye ninche enkukuo, enkaina enye natoorikia ninche rubat enye too lkererin; kepuo ninche aaya ina kop ntarasi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
